Read `AGENTS.md` at the repo root before writing any code. It is the canonical
instruction set for this repo — scope fence, hard constraints, architecture,
data model, and definition of done.

Two rules that are violated most often:
1. Build only the golden path. Everything else is out of scope.
2. Never claim affiliation with Hawaiʻi Tech Week; never invent event details.
